  "summary": "SSH command injection in libgit2 bundled by libgit2-sys",
  "details": "libgit2's libssh2 transport fails to escape SSH repository paths. An attacker-controlled URL, including a submodule URL processed during an explicit update, can execute commands on the SSH server under the authenticated account.\n\nThe Rust crate `libgit2-sys` bundles libgit2. Versions before `0.18.8` are affected when using the bundled library with the libssh2 transport. Version `0.18.8+1.9.7` includes the fix. Builds linked to a system libgit2 depend on that library's version and transport configuration; upstream fixes are available in libgit2 1.8.7 and 1.9.7.",
  "severity": [
